-- The mean is a prefix machine: state (sum,count), an emitted mean per prefix, and a finish that is the state after the last element. avg/ is therefore the last prefix of avg\ by construction, never the backend's own sum in its own order.
-- On the empty scope the mean declares no result and yields no row (A12); the count declares 0 and answers it.
--! registry ../registries/032-avg-fold-finish.reg

--! out 400 450 500 600
avg\ Weight @ Cow

--! out 600
avg/ Weight @ Cow

--! out 0 0 0 1
(avg\ Weight @ Cow) == (avg/ Weight @ Cow)

--! out 4
#/ Cow

--! out 2400
+/ Weight @ Cow

--! out
avg/ Weight @ None

--! out
avg\ Weight @ None

--! out 0
#/ None
